# The Debian source packages of the chorus-soloist image: one line per source package that
# deploy/soloist/debian-packages.pins names, its .dsc held to a sha256 and size.
# tools/soloist-sources.sh fetches each .dsc from snapshot.debian.org at the timestamp below,
# checks it, then fetches and checks every file its Checksums-Sha256 field lists; the release
# attaches them as chorus-soloist-v<ver>-debian-sources.tar (ADR 0241, docs/release.md).
# tools/conventions/check-pins.sh holds this file's shape, and that its (source, version) set is
# exactly the one the binary pins name.
#
# How it was resolved (2026-10-07): the main/source/Sources.xz index of each of the three
# suites the binary pins were resolved against, at the same snapshot timestamp, each index held
# to the sha256 its suite's Release file gives; a .dsc's sha256 and size are that index's
# Checksums-Sha256 entry for the file. All 47 are in debian trixie main. Moving the binary pins
# moves these in the same commit.
#
# snapshot = 20260918T000000Z
# archive = https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/
#
# Columns: source-package source-version dsc-sha256 dsc-size path
